    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dream, I was falling.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERMAGE</strong> is an arcade inspired surreal action roguelike bullet hell where you construct a wand of spells and use it to do battle. Each spell has its own traits, that when combined with spells with the same traits, unlocks the respective trait bonus. Spells can be upgraded to more powerful versions by purchasing additional copies from the shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/120b7cf1e7a2134f4bdd79ee483e1069.avif?t=1755642795\" width=567 height=201 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and cast swathes of colorful and powerful spells, with autobattler inspired trait and economy mechanics combined with wand crafting. Various upgrades can augment your powers and abilities on a whim - be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/e2f52477d1dec611ec218761543392ef.avif?t=1755642795\" width=564 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hordes of magick creatures, as the area around you collapses and becomes smaller. This game focuses on tight bullet hell gameplay combined with challenging and unique boss encounters that will test your strategical spellcrafting and mechanical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, one more thing,<strong><i> Parrying.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.poster.avif?t=1755642795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.webm?t=1755642795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.mp4?t=1755642795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features parrying as a main combat mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/f23d76ff983bccb260663704c680e2a8.avif?t=1755642795\" width=483 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are enthralled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Assimilate knowledge of unknown arcane. Journey to the sealed domain. Crack the locks and break the chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dream, I was falling...</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dream, I was falling.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERMAGE</strong> is an arcade inspired surreal action roguelike bullet hell where you construct a wand of spells and use it to do battle. Each spell has its own traits, that when combined with spells with the same traits, unlocks the respective trait bonus. Spells can be upgraded to more powerful versions by purchasing additional copies from the shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/120b7cf1e7a2134f4bdd79ee483e1069.avif?t=1755642795\" width=567 height=201 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and cast swathes of colorful and powerful spells, with autobattler inspired trait and economy mechanics combined with wand crafting. Various upgrades can augment your powers and abilities on a whim - be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/e2f52477d1dec611ec218761543392ef.avif?t=1755642795\" width=564 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hordes of magick creatures, as the area around you collapses and becomes smaller. This game focuses on tight bullet hell gameplay combined with challenging and unique boss encounters that will test your strategical spellcrafting and mechanical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, one more thing,<strong><i> Parrying.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.poster.avif?t=1755642795\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.webm?t=1755642795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/269f58caa48f89b377d245b1fe70423b.mp4?t=1755642795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features parrying as a main combat mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595210/extras/f23d76ff983bccb260663704c680e2a8.avif?t=1755642795\" width=483 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are enthralled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Assimilate knowledge of unknown arcane. Journey to the sealed domain. Crack the locks and break the chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dream, I was falling...</i></p>",
